        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Tubman University\n- People: William Vacanarat Shadrach Tubman\n- Places: Harper, Maryland County, Liberia\n- Roles: President of Liberia\n\nFacts:\n- William Vacanarat Shadrach Tubman was born on November 29, 1895, and died on July 23, 1971.\n- William Vacanarat Shadrach Tubman was a Liberian politician.\n- William Vacanarat Shadrach Tubman was elected as the 19th President of Liberia in 1944.\n- William Vacanarat Shadrach Tubman served as the 19th President of Liberia from 1944 until his death in 1971.\n- William V. S. Tubman University, commonly known as Tubman University, is a public university in Harper, Maryland County, Liberia.\n- Tubman University is named after William Vacanarat Shadrach Tubman.",
